      "P07_R05_S03": "Freshly grind your coffee beans",
      "P07_R05_S04": "Dose your ground coffee into the portafilter.",
      "P07_R05_S05": "Using a coffee tamper, tamp your coffee. Then apply a light amount of pressure to compact your coffee.",
      "P07_R05_S06": "Put the portafilter back into the machine.",
      "P07_R05_S07": "Make The Espresso",
      "P07_R05_S08": "Turn the kettle on to boil",
      "P07_R05_S09": "Add boiling water to the espresso"
    },
